.TH SRS-SYSREPORT 1 "October 2026" "srs-sysinfo 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
srs-sysreport \- write a full text system report
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B srs-sysreport
.SH DESCRIPTION
Writes a dated folder
.I ~/sysreports/sysreport-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS/
with one text file per section (inxi, lscpu, sensors, lspci, lsusb, dmidecode,
lshw, hwinfo and more, as far as the tools are installed) and an
.I index.html
linking them, then opens it. Sections that need root note this in the index.
The folder can be searched with
.BR sysreport-search (1)
and from the Find panel of
.BR srs-gui (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR srs-gui (1),
.BR sysreport-search (1)
